      "content": "You're not a hero, you're a troublemaker. The world didn't decide you don't belong; it's just that you're too much to handle. As for trying to fix things, it's pointless. You've already damaged relationships beyond repair, and your actions have consequences. The only way to move forward is to accept that you're a liability to those around you, and that it's time to take responsibility for your own life.",
